// OS1027: A colour literal written with four hexadecimal digits instead of six.
//
// The second claim is the run being dropped rather than emitted as a token of
// its own, which leaves the assignment with nothing on its right. It is claimed
// because it happens, not because it is wanted: the day the run is emitted this
// case reports one diagnostic and the second line below is deleted.
// expect OS1027 at 14:8, length 5
// expect OS1022 at 14:13, length 0

version 1

study("Rejection case")

tint = #ff88
plot(close, "Close", tint)
